questions.explanation:
**Given:**

&ang;P = 60&deg;

&ang;Q = 70&deg;

**Formula used:**

Angle at incenter: &ang;PIQ = 90&deg; + (&ang;R &divide; 2)

**Calculations:**

&rArr; &ang;R = 180 &minus; (60 + 70) = 50&deg;

&rArr; &ang;PIQ = 90 + (50 &divide; 2)

&rArr; &ang;PIQ = 90 + 25 = 115&deg;

**&there4; &ang;PIQ = 115&deg;**

